,"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-29T04:04:23Z","updated_at":"2024-12-29T04:04:23Z","body":"Okay, I see the difference, but isn't this too many?\nWe should have guard_rect_selection for backbuffercopy then, maybe even for every canvasitem?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2564604738/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2564607680","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100874#issuecomment-2564607680","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100874","id":2564607680,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y3M7A","user":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-29T04:20:28Z","updated_at":"2024-12-29T04:22:06Z","body":"> We should have guard_rect_selection for backbuffercopy then, maybe even for every canvasitem?\r\n\r\nMaybe, but some of the derived class of `CanvasItem` should not, like `Sprite2D` and `AnimatedSprite2D`, which makes more sense if selecting the `rect` of one of their instance (basically the texture area) can automatically select the instance itself.\r\nPerhaps we can upgrade the `guard_rect_selection` to a dynamic property in `CanvasItem`, i.e., if `_edit_use_rect()` returns `true`, the property will be checkable in the inspector.\r\nI currently don't want to change it in this pr, because such modification is off-topic and should be the theme in another pr. It's still possible before 4.4 gets it stable version released.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2564607680/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2580446149","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100874#issuecomment-2580446149","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100874","id":2580446149,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZznvF","user":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://